@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+# Disable built-in pets
+
+The Wayland package enables this feature during preparation. It prevents the
+built-in pet/Mini overlay from opening or prewarming, including restoration of
+saved state and direct shortcut calls. Mini commands are
+unavailable in desktop and renderer command registries, and `/pet` is disabled.
+Saved preferences and installed pet artwork are retained. The shared Quick Chat
+shortcut controller is preserved; its pet fallback cannot open the overlay.
+
+This is independent of the optional `pet-overlay` compositor adaptation.
+Descriptors identify unique semantic owners, reject missing or partial patches,
+and validate idempotence. The packaged ASAR is checked again before packaging.
+
+Run `node --test linux-features/disable-pets/test.js`. Set
+`CODEX_SIGNED_EXTRACTED_APP` to check a verified extracted official bundle;
+set `CODEX_TEST_ALREADY_PATCHED=1` to require an already disabled bundle.
